  73:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  * GPIO driver provide a generic and very flexible software interface for all standard digital I/O 
  74:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  * Each port slice has individual interfaces for the operation as General Purpose I/O and it furthe
  75:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  * connectivity to the on-chip periphery and the control for the pad characteristics.
  76:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  *
  77:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  * The driver is divided into Input and Output mode.
